  "story": {
    "text": "Three years later, with the war over, Meg marries John Brooke in the old {PARLOUR}, in a simple gown she made {HERSELF}, with lilies of the {VALLEY} in her hair. There are no grand {GUESTS}, only {FRIENDS}. Then she goes off on John’s arm to the {COTTAGE} he has made ready for her, the Dove-cote.",
